            },
            "description": "Expected answer: array of 7 strings (introduction + 3 lunch + 3 dinner).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"selected_route\": \"晋祠 → 平遥古城\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-12-02\",\n  \"number_of_people\": 2,\n  \"budget\": 100,\n  \"distance_range\": \"3公里\",\n  \"meal_preferences\": [\n    \"午餐\",\n    \"晚餐\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
